{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年31歲的江嘉敏去年宣布離巢後有一段時間曝光率大減，但近日在國慶日現身沙田馬場，當日她穿上純白低胸連身裙亮相，性感造型引起網民熱議。近年她積極經營社交平台，開直播與網民近距離互動，又時常在各大社交平台分享美照，可是留言卻多為負評。日前有網民為江嘉敏身材平反，卻又因另一件事遭網民圍剿。</p><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏性感一面。（IG：@kaman_kong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260305/1106205657775738880436589.jpeg/EVK1X3psRqtpqMk0yit85vcpM6uBPct-JaIcEiWiHBI\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏性感一面。（IG：@kaman_kong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏真係女大十八變。（IG：@kaman_kong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260305/1106205660284063744749208.jpeg/UZ1A4tXg0VEPhCgZTl6ylizBDu-i9lQfMKoJJjCqCSY\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏真係女大十八變。（IG：@kaman_kong）</figcaption></figure><p>江嘉敏身材獲平反再遭網民圍剿</p><p>江嘉敏身形一直時肥時瘦，多次因為身材發福或水腫成為網民熱話。日前有網民在Threads發文疑為其平反，以「江x敏」稱呼，「話說今日見到江×敏真人 本身以為係好似的人，因為比起之前啲人影佢的片同相瘦好多 然後問同事真係佢 想講佢真係真係瘦，佢著貼身白色長袖，對手臂一定瘦過我 原來上鏡肥廿磅係真.佢真人唔似人地影，亦都唔似ig 的佢 想幫佢平反的程度，真心佢係瘦架」。</p><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏性感美照獲網民洗版讚好。（IG@kaman_kong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187358379094708224094618.jpeg/R9Z-QIgY6uUAmYZ7AsCXSmTntb64AdKQWptG0VqbRtE\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏性感美照獲網民洗版讚好。（IG@kaman_kong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏南大洋游水自嘲「飲到成肚水」。（IG@kaman_kong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187357771939450880406182.jpeg/NFoiVEFfkHVoCCuy_1a8DZdSLj1dPycXlzc-4Jc3PuA\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏南大洋游水自嘲「飲到成肚水」。（IG@kaman_kong）</figcaption></figure><p>江嘉敏親上水回覆該則帖文：「好日唔上threads，第一個post就係你 我諗應該係講緊......我啩 咁啱我今日真係著咗貼身白色長袖 咁啱我又係叫江X敏 我真係冇嗰啲post 肥到咁嚇人嘅，唔知用咩機可以影到我咁恐怖 𣎴過我又真係唔係瘦嘅」，並多謝其他為其平反的網民。可是江嘉敏的回覆卻引來網民批評，指她時常更新Threads，「你隔日出個post 點好日唔上thread」、「好日唔上threads？你一個禮拜出咁多次post喎」。</p><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏獲平反身材。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1194001596216905728482036.jpeg/GP1OLMmDGvt7wD1opEpJEmVSuYIzwYu7E3TirRN04q0\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏獲平反身材。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"可是她留言稱「好日唔上threads」引來網民圍剿。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1194001593599528960430157.jpeg/YwieiwwD2ANpl38T96yPBAe2c1iLzGnnCH6K5Ah-iuQ\"/><figcaption>可是她留言稱「好日唔上threads」引來網民圍剿。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"翻查江嘉敏Threads主頁，她確密密更新。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1194001626143657984431602.jpeg/XOff8RvIvyT62P1klrX8AI7zr-2B0XO25hrwJeYa8CU\"/><figcaption>翻查江嘉敏Threads主頁，她確密密更新。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"近日亦積極回覆網民留言。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1194001623886991360291650.jpeg/rPZxUzdZfDVuP9jXRpFHHfZ-g66vAp-d2HZsk9h2bJM\"/><figcaption>近日亦積極回覆網民留言。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏時常更新Threads帖文。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1194001621223477248526430.jpeg/kI86xgVXCujkG_3HtGqJrkkqG0dFvYYXeZ-jJHmfoyQ\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏時常更新Threads帖文。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏時常更新Threads帖文。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1194001618371219456673485.jpeg/2k0tqcK4KdKHFYJ_La_NYrMKA2FVnJHuOGYvGDhmLxg\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏時常更新Threads帖文。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏愛於Threads分享美照。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1194001615762231296360481.jpeg/AMtnRcq4N5ACjjc1dpGHkgWb9k52cnFSSbf9wkm3_cI\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏愛於Threads分享美照。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏愛在社交平台發文。（IG@kaman_kong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251117/1067119796556140544506719.jpeg/DWYJjlCFzZ75qskd-uRLw-A9B5vl6nlE85i_RfOYv0U\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏愛在社交平台發文。（IG@kaman_kong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏認為演員之路就像不斷闖入一個又一個未知的「心理森林」，十分感激這段經歷豐富了她的人生閱歷。（IG@kaman_kong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260214/1099342893937594368435781.jpeg/D0HV1emOdnVPN7W2Sgji0Ru93ectOjWNC1eBfwtXgX8\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏認為演員之路就像不斷闖入一個又一個未知的「心理森林」，十分感激這段經歷豐富了她的人生閱歷。（IG@kaman_kong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏亦藉著劇中的故事寄意，願世界多一點愛，更要拒絕任何形式的欺凌。（IG@kaman_kong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260214/1099343112485998592580126.jpeg/tJua8ngexRV6BZ2FvAdIB-9bhGvAlebK-MHWD_jB1g8\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏亦藉著劇中的故事寄意，願世界多一點愛，更要拒絕任何形式的欺凌。（IG@kaman_kong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏語重心長地提醒大家：「每一句惡言、每一次排擠，都可能成為他人心中難以癒合的傷。」（IG@kaman_kong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260214/1099343299426127872180527.jpeg/Ui5WCKzMmyT_4edFADHhBIn9yQp1QyPe_5hGpP-YRqQ\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏語重心長地提醒大家：「每一句惡言、每一次排擠，都可能成為他人心中難以癒合的傷。」（IG@kaman_kong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏大跳手勢舞。(抖音截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260416/1121447249512239104249381.jpeg/x-x031qOEzyfo0xMU9NCecugRK9BF4myYGYsHGBmLBw\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏大跳手勢舞。(抖音截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏個鼻好直。(抖音截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260416/1121447252679069696382079.jpeg/78j8o6CKYEFuzwk1KIdghyxXDr9dbE58YUMv2mFDL9o\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏個鼻好直。(抖音截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏顏值大升級。(抖音截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260416/1121447254742798336475186.jpeg/MJIaNySjMC1PzlURIWNBh2L-NDZTK9I1OhkMazoZDGs\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏顏值大升級。(抖音截圖)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T16:21:40.082415+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1132,"images":18,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T15:59:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T17:38:36.809013+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T16:18:34.213586+00:00","content_hash":"cbebba29701a886a482af3c91cca1df52895c460100a07b2101566f03ed6ab2b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}